                                                "sense_id": "64853a38-03eb-33a1-97cd-ab6eba38f307",
                                                "text": "'Tis better that the Enemie ſeeke vs,\nSo ſhall he waſte his meanes, weary his Souldiers,\nDoing himſelfe offence, whil'ſt we lying ſtill,\nAre full of reſt, defence, and nimbleneſſe."
                                            }
